{"n": 1102, "w": 1000, "h": 764, "img": "1102.webp", "text": "ELECTROMECHANICAL TOP\n\nGeneral information\n\nRemoval of complete top Is identical with procedures for removal of mechanl-\ncal lop, whereby additionally top push rad and push rod for top tensioning\nbow must be detached on top drive.\n\nTop drive must be adjusted, refer to 54 34 023, after removal and Installation of\ncomplete top or alteration of top adjustment.\n\nM top cannot be lifted out of top box by hand In spite of correctly disengaged\ntop drive, check top adjustment - refer to 54 34 023.\n\nLubricate surface between derive lever and trailing lever on top drive lightly with\nPolylub GLY 801° when necessary.\n\nLock joint head bolting of top push rod to top with Loctite No. 638; tightening\ntorque = 25 Nm (18 ft. Ibs.).\n\ni power supply to control unit Is Interrupted (disconnection of battery/control\nunit) at an Intermediate position between top opened and closed, restoring\noperation requires disengaging drives and moving top to a “defined” position,\nRefer to page 54-44 for Information about restoring operation,\n\n* Source of Supply: HWE\n\n94-43\n\nDescription of Operation\n\nOpening Top\n\nTurn ignition key to \"R” position,\n\nUnlock top on cow! panel and lift above dead center.\n\nCowl panel switch switches ground lead of top operating switch to continulty.\nOperate top operating switch In open direction and keep It pressed In during\nentire opening action. Top motor receives power, top tensioning bow Is run up\nand top motor Is switched off when top tensioning bow reaches top dead cen-\nter. Top storage box lid motor receives power, top storage box lid locks are un-\nlocked and top storage box lid Is opened. Top motor now moves top tension-\ning bow down and stores top In storage box. Top storage box lid motor closes\nstorage box lid.\n\nClosing Top\n\nTurn ignition key to “R” position.\n\nOperate top operating switch In close direction and keep it pressed In during\nentire closing action. Top storage box lid motor receives power and moves top\nout of storage box. Top tensioning bow Is run up. Top storage box lid motor re-\ncelves power to close and lock storage box Id. Top motor recelves power and\nruns top tensioning bow down. Top must be pulled down manually over dead\ncenter to cowl panel and locked on cow! panel.\n\nNote:\n\nEntire top operation Is controlled by microswitches mounted on gearboxes of\ntop storage box lid motor and top motor. Two microswitches are mounted on\neach gearbox. Microswitches report Instantaneous top position to control unit.\n\nTop operation is not possible, it\nbattery voltage Is < 10.5 V (engine should be running to prevent battery\nvoltage from dropping below 10.5 V during top operation),\n\n— vehicle rolls (speedometer A signal received),\n\n- Ignition key Is In “0” position or\n\n— top ts not unlocked.\n\nTop operation Is locked for 15 minutes If there Is seizure or blocking three\ntimes during top opening or closing action. Lock can be eliminated by switch-\nIng ignition on and off.", "words": [["ELECTROMECHANICAL", 0.0207, 0.0897, 0.1487, 0.1016], ["TOP", 0.1527, 0.0897, 0.1749, 0.1016], ["General", 0.0207, 0.1385, 0.0635, 0.1504], ["information", 0.0675, 0.1398, 0.1265, 0.1504], ["Removal", 0.0217, 0.1722, 0.0685, 0.184], ["of", 0.0726, 0.1735, 0.0827, 0.184], ["complete", 0.0867, 0.1735, 0.1336, 0.1867], ["top", 0.1376, 0.1735, 0.1547, 0.1867], ["Is", 0.1588, 0.1735, 0.1668, 0.184], ["identical", 0.1709, 0.1722, 0.2157, 0.184], ["with", 0.2198, 0.1735, 0.2419, 0.184], ["procedures", 0.246, 0.1735, 0.3059, 0.1867], ["for", 0.31, 0.1722, 0.3251, 0.184], ["removal", 0.3281, 0.1722, 0.371, 0.184], ["of", 0.374, 0.1722, 0.3851, 0.1827], ["mechanl-", 0.3891, 0.1722, 0.4365, 0.1827], ["cal", 0.0207, 0.1893, 0.0368, 0.2012], ["lop,", 0.0423, 0.1906, 0.0625, 0.2025], ["whereby", 0.0655, 0.1893, 0.1099, 0.2038], ["additionally", 0.1129, 0.1893, 0.1749, 0.2038], ["top", 0.1789, 0.1906, 0.1951, 0.2038], ["push", 0.19